{
  "workflowId": "100002355227157",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_REQUISITION_CREATION_GUIDE",
  "name": "Purchase Requisition Creation Guide",
  "description": "This PR creation guide will help users search for catalog items or services, add those to a requisition and submit it. The guide will also provide deep links to product details, shopping cart and requisition details pages, should the user need to review the data. Users can refine results within the chat interaction itself and can edit the requisition line while reviewing it. If users cannot find the required product or service in the catalog, the agent will guide users to create a noncatalog request.",
