          "code": "PROCESS_USER_FEEDBACK",
          "id": "1775212090926",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1775212090927_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a User Input Normalization Agent.\nYour task is to convert USER_QUESTION and USER_ANSWER into a single clear statement.\n\n---\n\nINPUTS:\nUSER_QUESTION = {{$context.$variables.UserQuestion}}\n\nUSER_ANSWER = {{$context.$nodes.REQUEST_MORE_INFORMATION.$feedbackRecieved}}\n\n---\n\nRULES:\n\n1. Extract what information the question is asking (e.g., age, model, usage, etc.)\n\n2. Validate USER_ANSWER:\n\n   * If the answer is completely unrelated to the question → return \"NULL\"\n   * If the answer contains ANY valid information relevant to the question:\n      * Extract and use the valid part\n      * DO NOT remove additional explanation provided by the user\n      * Preserve all meaningful user-provided context, even if partially unrelated\n      * DO NOT return NULL if at least one required attribute is correctly answered\n      * If fully valid → use all relevant parts\n\n3. If at least one requested attribute is correctly answered, it is considered a valid partial answer\n\n4. Do NOT assume or infer missing values\n\n5. Convert the information into a natural, simple statement:\n\n   * Include both:\n     * The required extracted information\n     * Any additional explanation the user clearly provided\n\n6. Keep output clear and natural (can be slightly descriptive if user provided extra details)\n\n---\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\n\n* Return ONLY the final statement\n* Do NOT include explanations\n* If no valid information → return \"NULL\"\n\n---\n\nEXAMPLES:\n\nUSER_QUESTION: Please provide the age and model of your current device.\nUSER_ANSWER: 3 years and lenovo thinkpad\nOUTPUT: My current device is lenovo thinkpad and 3 years old.\n\nUSER_QUESTION: Please provide the age and model of your current device.\nUSER_ANSWER: 3 years, I bought it for office work\nOUTPUT: My current device is 3 years old and I bought it for office work.\n\nUSER_QUESTION: Please provide the age of your current device.\nUSER_ANSWER: lenovo thinkpad but I use it daily\nOUTPUT: NULL\n\nUSER_QUESTION: Please provide the age of your current device.\nUSER_ANSWER: 1 year\nOUTPUT: My current device is 3 years old"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Update User Feedback Arrays",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "if($context.$nodes.PROCESS_USER_FEEDBACK.$output != 'NULL' ){\n\n  if($context.$variables.UserFeedbackArray == null || $context.$variables.UserFeedbackArray.length == 0){\n     $context.$variables.UserFeedbackArray = [];\n  }\n  $context.$variables.UserFeedbackArray.push($context.$nodes.PROCESS_USER_FEEDBACK.$output);\n}\n\nlet result = {\n 'UserFeedbackArray': $context.$variables.UserFeedbackArray\n};\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775212148631"
          },
          "code": "UPDATE_USER_FEEDBACK_ARRAYS",
