              "value": "<div style=\"width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;border: 1px solid #f5c6cb;background-color: #fdecea;color: #721c24;padding: 6px 6px 15px 6px;border-radius: 6px;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;margin-top: 20px;\"> \n\n<span class=\"icon-block\"></span>I can’t process your request because this item is restricted as per your organization’s procurement policies.\n<br>\n{{$context.$nodes.PROCUREMENT_POLICY_ENFORCEMENT.$output.MESSAGE}} \n\n</div>\n<br>\n{{$context.$nodes.PROCUREMENT_POLICY_ENFORCEMENT.$output.ADDITIONAL_MESSAGE}} \n<style>\n.icon-block {\n    display: inline-block;width: 16px; height: 16px;border: 1px solid #721c24;border-radius: 50%;position: relative;margin-right: 5px;top: 2px;box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n.icon-block::after {\n    content: \"\";position: absolute;width: 10px;height: 2px; background: #721c24;top: 50%;left: 50%;transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(0deg);\n}\n</style>"
