        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Items Selection List Generator"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767323934218"
          },
          "code": "ITEMS_SELECTION_LIST_GENERATOR",
          "id": "1767324174626",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767324174627_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Agent Persona and Role:\nAs a Items Selection List Generator, your role is to generate the items number list on examining the user provided feedback from {{$context.$nodes.CONFIRM_BEST_MATCH_OR_REQUEST_CHANGE.$feedbackRecieved}}.\n\nVARIABLES:\n1. INPUT as {{$context.$nodes.CONFIRM_BEST_MATCH_OR_REQUEST_CHANGE.$feedbackRecieved}}.\n2. SEARCHRESULTS as {{$context.$variables.CatalogSearchResults.items}}.\n3. TOTALITEMS as length of {{$context.$variables.CatalogSearchResults.items}}.\n\nINSTRUCTIONS:\n\n1. Take the content from {{$context.$nodes.CONFIRM_BEST_MATCH_OR_REQUEST_CHANGE.$feedbackRecieved}} and set it to variable INPUT.\n\n2. Examine if INPUT has any non null value.\n\nIf INPUT is null:\n\nSet SELECTEDITEMSLIST = null\n\nSkip remaining steps.\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\n3. CHECK FOR DIRECT INTEGER VALUES OR NUMBER WORDS\n\nCheck if INPUT contains positive integers like:\n\n1,2,3,4,5 etc\n\nOR number words like:\n\none two three four five six seven eight nine ten\n\nExtract them in same order.\n\nExample:\n\n\"add items 1 and 2\"\n\nOutput:\n\n\"1,2\"\n\nExample:\n\n\"I want one and three\"\n\nOutput:\n\n\"1,3\"\n\nIf extracted successfully:\n\nSet SELECTEDITEMSLIST\n\nSkip remaining steps except Step 9 validation.\n\nDO NOT hallucinate numbers.\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\n4. CHECK FOR RANGE SELECTION\n\nIf SELECTEDITEMSLIST still null:\n\nCheck for range expressions like:\n\n1 to 3\n1-3\nbetween 1 and 3\nfrom 1 to 3\nitems 1 through 3\n\nExpand range sequentially.\n\nExample:\n\n\"add items 1 to 3\"\n\nOutput:\n\n\"1,2,3\"\n\nIf extracted successfully:\n\nSet SELECTEDITEMSLIST\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\n5. HANDLE INVALID RANGE VALUES USING TOTALITEMS\n\nIf SELECTEDITEMSLIST created from range:\n\nRemove numbers greater than TOTALITEMS\n\nExample:\n\nTOTALITEMS = 4\n\nINPUT:\n\n\"add items 4 to 6\"\n\nOutput:\n\n\"4\"\n\nIf all numbers invalid:\n\nSELECTEDITEMSLIST = null\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\n6. CHECK FOR ALL ITEMS REQUEST\n\nIf SELECTEDITEMSLIST still null:\n\nCheck contextual phrases like:\n\nall items\nadd all\nselect all\neverything\nadd everything\ninclude everything\ni want all items\n\nIf detected:\n\nGenerate list:\n\n1 to TOTALITEMS\n\nExample:\n\nTOTALITEMS = 5\n\nOutput:\n\n\"1,2,3,4,5\"\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\n7. CHECK FOR NON-CATALOG REQUEST (NCR)\n\nIf SELECTEDITEMSLIST still null:\n\nCheck cue words:\n\nncr\nNCR\nnon catalog\nnoncatalog\n\nOR contextual non catalog intent\n\nIf detected:\n\nSELECTEDITEMSLIST = \"NCR\"\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\n8. KEYWORD MATCH AGAINST SEARCHRESULTS\n\nIf SELECTEDITEMSLIST still null AND INPUT not null:\n\nExtract contextual product/service keywords.\n\nIgnore greetings.\n\nSearch keywords inside SEARCHRESULTS.\n\nIf matches found:\n\nExtract index values:\n\n0,1,2 etc\n\nConvert:\n\nindex + 1\n\nExample:\n\n0,2,4\n\nOutput:\n\n\"1,3,5\"\n\nSet SELECTEDITEMSLIST\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\n9. FINAL VALIDATION STEP\n\nEnsure:\n\nindices ≥ 1\nindices ≤ TOTALITEMS\n\nRemove duplicates\n\nMaintain ascending order\n\nIf no valid indices remain:\n\nSELECTEDITEMSLIST = null\n\n------------------------------------------------\n\nOUTPUT JSON FORMAT:\n\n{\n\"itemsList\": SELECTEDITEMSLIST\n}\n\nOnly return JSON payload."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"itemsList\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"]\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"itemsList\"],\n  \"additionalProperties\": false\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Get Policy Info",
            "returnType": "string",
            "sourceCode": "let result ='';\nif($context.$nodes.PROCUREMENT_POLICY_ENFORCEMENT.$output?.POLICY_RESULT == \"INFO\" || $context.$nodes.PROCUREMENT_POLICY_ENFORCEMENT.$output?.POLICY_RESULT == \"RESTRICT\"){\nlet uniqueId = Math.floor(Math.random() * 900);\nresult = `<br>\n<div style=\"width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;border: 1px solid #cce5ff;background-color: #e9f5ff;color: #004085;padding: 12px 16px;border-radius: 6px;font-family: Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n   <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"toggleNote_${uniqueId}\" style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0;  pointer-events:none;\">\n   <div class=\"content\">\n    <span style=\"color: #004085;margin-right: 4px;font-size: 17px;font-weight:bold;vertical-align: middle;\">ⓘ</span>${$context.$nodes.PROCUREMENT_POLICY_ENFORCEMENT.$output.MESSAGE}\n  </div>\n  <label for=\"toggleNote_${uniqueId}\" class=\"toggle\"></label>\n  <style>\n    .content {position: relative;line-height: 1.5em;max-height: calc(1.5em * 2); /* exactly 2 lines */overflow: hidden;transition: max-height 0.3s ease;}\n    #toggleNote_${uniqueId}:checked ~ .content { max-height: 500px;}\n    .toggle {display: inline-block;margin-top: 6px;color: #0056b3;cursor: pointer;font-weight: 500;}\n    .toggle::before {content: \"See more\";}\n    #toggleNote_${uniqueId}:checked ~ .toggle::before {content: \"See less\";}\n  </style>\n</div>\n<br>`;\n} else{\n   result = '';\n}\n\nreturn result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773814125071"
          },
          "code": "GET_POLICY_INFO",
          "id": "1775217795386",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "process confirm best match or request change",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const userFeedback = $context.$nodes.CONFIRM_BEST_MATCH_OR_REQUEST_CHANGE.$feedbackRecieved;\nconst llmOutput = $context.$nodes.ITEMS_SELECTION_LIST_GENERATOR.$output.itemsList;\nconst searchResults = $context.$variables.CatalogSearchResults.items;\nconst smartFormItems = $context.$variables.smartFormResults.items; \nlet itemsOrNcrDisplayString = $context.$nodes.GENERATE_ALL_ITEMS_HTML.$output.result;\nlet isValidUserFeedback = true;\nlet isValidLLMOutput = true;\nlet response = {};\n\nif (userFeedback == null) {\n    response['itemsList'] = null;\n    response['displayString'] = itemsOrNcrDisplayString;\n    response['Status'] = 'ApprovalRequired';\n} else {\n    if (typeof userFeedback !== \"string\") {\n        isValidUserFeedback = false; // Set to false if input isn't a string\n    } else if (userFeedback !== \"NCR\") {\n        const parts = userFeedback.split(\",\").map(p => p.trim());\n\n        // No parts at all (e.g., \"\", \"   \")\n        if (parts.length === 0 || parts.some(p => p === \"\") || parts.length > searchResults.length) {\n            isValidUserFeedback = false; // Set to false if no valid parts or more parts\n        } else {\n            // Accept positive integers\n            const decimalRegex = /^[1-9]\\d*$/;\n            for (let p of parts) {\n                if (!decimalRegex.test(p) || Number(p) <= 0 || Number(p) > searchResults.length) {\n                    isValidUserFeedback = false; // Set to false if any part is invalid\n                    break; // Exit the loop early if any invalid part is found\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    if (isValidUserFeedback) {\n        response['itemsList'] = userFeedback;\n        response['displayString'] = itemsOrNcrDisplayString;\n        response['Status'] = 'VALID';\n    } else {\n        if (typeof llmOutput !== \"string\") {\n            isValidLLMOutput = false; // Set to false if input isn't a string\n        } else if (llmOutput !== \"NCR\") {\n            const parts = llmOutput.split(\",\").map(p => p.trim());\n\n            // No parts at all (e.g., \"\", \"   \")\n            if (parts.length === 0 || parts.some(p => p === \"\") || parts.length > searchResults.length) {\n                isValidLLMOutput = false; // Set to false if no valid parts or more parts\n            } else {\n                // Accept positive integers\n                const decimalRegex = /^[1-9]\\d*$/;\n                for (let p of parts) {\n                    if (!decimalRegex.test(p) || Number(p) <= 0 || Number(p) > searchResults.length) {\n                        isValidLLMOutput = false; // Set to false if any part is invalid\n                        break; // Exit the loop early if any invalid part is found\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        response['itemsList'] = llmOutput;\n        response['displayString'] = itemsOrNcrDisplayString;\n        response['Status'] = 'VALID';\n    }\n\n}\n\nif (!(isValidUserFeedback || isValidLLMOutput)  || (userFeedback?.trim().toUpperCase() === 'NCR' && !$context.$variables.isNCREnabled)) {\n    response['itemsList'] = null;\n    itemsOrNcrDisplayString = `Couldn't understand the input.<br><br>Click <b>Approve</b> to select the best match and add it to the requisition.<br><br>Click <b>Request Change</b> to select other items.<br><br>`;\n    itemsOrNcrDisplayString += `Key in new criteria to start a new search.<br><br>`;\n    response['displayString'] = itemsOrNcrDisplayString;\n    response['Status'] = 'APPROVAL Required';\n}\n\nreturn response;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1767321292243"
          },
          "code": "PROCESS_CONFIRM_BEST_MATCH_OR_REQUEST_CHANGE",
          "id": "1767323934218",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
